<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Initial Disclosures</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 11px; margin: 24px; }
  h1 { font-size: 16px; } h2 { font-size: 13px; border-bottom: 1px solid #999; }
  table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; }
  td, th { border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 4px 6px; text-align: left; }
  .num { text-align: right; }
</style></head>
<body>
<h1>Initial Disclosures</h1>
<p>Provided by {{lenderName}} — issued {{disclosureDate}}.</p>
<table>
<tr><th>Borrower(s)</th><td>{{#each borrowerNames}}{{this}}{{#unless @last}}, {{/unless}}{{/each}}</td></tr>
<tr><th>Property</th><td>{{propertyAddress}}</td></tr>
<tr><th>Intent to Occupy</th><td>{{intentToOccupy}}</td></tr>
</table>
<h2>Loan Summary</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Loan Amount</th><td class="num">{{loanAmount}}</td></tr>
<tr><th>Loan Type</th><td>{{loanType}}</td></tr>
<tr><th>Term</th><td class="num">{{termMonths}} months</td></tr>
<tr><th>Interest Rate</th><td class="num">{{interestRate}}%</td></tr>
</table>
<p>This document accompanies the Loan Estimate and summarizes the terms
of your application as of the disclosure date.</p>
</body></html>
